{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Debugging-orchestrator session driving parentless bug tickets to zero via background /rebar-debug agents, with every agent-reported close verified against ground truth (ticket status + completion signature + Gerrit merged + both votes + ancestry on origin/main).\n\nPARENTLESS BUGS VERIFIED CLOSED THIS SESSION:\n- beige-acute-bobolink (01c4) — Gerrit change 2521 merged 8a38aa76 (LLM-Review+1, Verified+1). class=regression, caused_by=d80d-7be7-1c0a-4231. RC: gate_status reported a terminal verdict without a job-scoped REVIEW_RESULT receipt. Two agents converged on the SAME change (original RCA/fix + takeover that supplied the required reuse-verdict test as PS3→merged PS4); Change-Id preserved, no duplicate change.\n- tomophobic-ambient-killdeer — Gerrit change 2532 merged 1d3e4f14 (both votes). class=regression, caused_by=explicit→clerkish-cloggy-cod (03a9), introduced by cbc5b288. RC: plan_review_precheck bug-tier arm ran the DET floor but kept only P4 blocking, downgrading P1 (missing ## Acceptance Criteria) and P10 (missing Testing/Verification) to advisory — so bug-typed tickets could be signed PASS over AC-less plans while task siblings blocked. Fix keeps P1/P10/P4 authoritative for bug tier via _BUG_TIER_BLOCKING_DET_CRITERIA (src/rebar/llm/plan_review/workflow_ops.py). RED→GREEN regression test tests/unit/test_bug_review_tier.py.\n\nAPPROVED FEATURE LANDED (retyped bug→task):\n- seraphic-taming-terrier (3ed6) — gate-op keepalive. Gerrit change 2539 MERGED (LLM-Review+1, Verified+1), closed. Emits a coalesced keepalive at LLM-call boundaries via logging as WARNING rebar.llm.keepalive (at/above default level to reset supervisor watchdogs), synchronous main-thread, no daemon/no total-cap, additive. TDD RED→GREEN test tests/unit/test_llm_keepalive.py; silence-tolerance tests (test_llm_timeouts.py) kept GREEN; doc warnings in docs/plan-review-gate.md + docs/config.md.\n\nAC4 LAUNDERED-ATTESTATION FINDING (surfaced from tomophobic AC4): 15 tickets received a signed plan-review PASS over plans with DET P1 (missing ACs) via the bug-tier floor-downgrade defect fixed in 2532. Full list recorded in session_facts ac4_laundered_attestations. Re-review of seraphic-taming-terrier confirmed CLEAN: its old laundered (bug-tier) attestation was SUPERSEDED — retyped to task, real 6-AC+Testing plan, re-reviewed under the FIXED floor; review SHA c3bff723 is a descendant of floor-fix 1d3e4f14, so plan-review ran WITH the fix present (task-tier strict path). This also validates the floor fix on a formerly-laundered ticket. Remaining 14 tickets held pending an operator decision on remediation (re-review vs reopen vs accept; some already closed).\n\nGERRIT STATUS: all of this session's dispatched changes (2521, 2532, 2539) MERGED + verified-closed. 11 OPEN changes at Verified −1 under the shared bot identity RebarBotNava are the OTHER session's f79d (representation-mirror) / 78f2 epic children — all PARENTED (not parentless bugs), so out of this session's mandate. Failure modes: \"require resolvable rebar ticket: FAILED\" (trailers are correctly-formatted full-canonical IDs that resolve LOCALLY but CI's tickets-branch checkout lags creation = sync race, not a bad trailer) and one pytest failure (2533). Flagged, not driven (not this session's workstream + no-new-workstreams hold).\n\nDISK P1 cyclopean-bloodshot-hoatzin (in_progress, NOT closed): Defect-2 paging gap DONE + applied live (alarms breaching, code-review scratch vol codified 30→60); one induced-stop verification remains before close. Defect-1 ceiling → epic endowed-upset-scaup scaffolded + design-approved, implementation HELD (new workstream).\n\nNOT this session's: janitor 673c, epic wide-wimpy-insect (other session), f79d/78f2 epics. Standing rules honored: no --force (escalate to human); no timeout on gate/LLM ops; tracker ops via rebar/MCP; no workspace state files (session SQL only). All background /rebar-debug agents (3d4816fe, 8f173803, 27fd60c7, ca0c033c) are idle/complete."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788399113392411569,"uuid":"093d5578-53f7-4a27-b157-8f04c6968dce"}